_nc_ohc=8I-pDLdrflsQ7kNvwGZRFXa&_nc_oc=Adqkwk4sni3ZsaUTPVH1WtNl34fmPNOyjY22p-SbyTfwSoXWCX0mwyvnuG2rOkTqMNI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRz6M9lByeocNZtwRVXOUBknei4cQ4FU4kJfEDZ6G5ZBQ&oe=6AF347BE"}, {"file_name": "06-welcome-centered-2560x1440.png", "id": "1068856906064419", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_1068856909397752_858119733054736554_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3Jfl5B-u6IAQ7kNvwHXw5bz&_nc_oc=AdqQFPzYv0JWyzu0v4HNRWC2mK2JARmBLcqrsqwrZ5Yija8JsJx9cdM_IX6cB68-uh0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRym9Yx5Wy3o11BMtOkT6xfudYudAdkdoOO5VcY02s2WQ&oe=6AF3541A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "3D Screen Mirroring", "keywords": ["Mirroring", "Mac", "3D", "Cinema", "Streaming"], "long_description": "3D Screen Mirroring brings your Mac workspace into Meta Quest with real-time 3D depth streaming. Experience your desktop, apps, browser windows, and videos with added depth on a large private virtual screen creating an immersive space for work, browsing, and watching.\n\nPlace your screen comfortably in your space. Adjust its size, curvature, picture fit, and ambient lighting with easy headset controls.\n\nWatch videos from a folder on your Mac. Browse videos and subfolders, pause, seek, skip, and repeat playback from Quest. Choose subtitles and adjust their size and background. Switch between your screen, an app window, and video playback while staying connected.\n\nDiscover your Mac on the same Wi-Fi network and connect through the guided setup. USB viewing is also available with the included setup guide. Explore the offline demo before connecting.", "short_description": "Turn your Mac display into a depth-aware spatial screen on Meta Quest with real-time 3D depth streaming."}]}, "developer_name": "3D Screen Mirroring", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://screenmirroring.kc-f90.workers.dev/privacy-policy